      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am really sorry you are feeling this exhaustion and want to shed light on a truth that many others feel: healing isn't about getting back to \"before\" but about creating a new, painful version of life where you can stay. It is okay to feel like the pain is heavier than the effort right now, and temporary feelings of hopelessness do not define your entire future. Please consider reaching out to a crisis hotline or a professional therapist who can help you navigate this deep fatigue without having to face it entirely alone; there are people ready to listen without judgment or demand for \"hope.\"\n**If you are in immediate distress, please contact the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline (call or text 988 in the U.S.) or go to your nearest emergency room.**",
